{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-exam","level":"A1","kind":"exam","title":{"de":"A1-Abschlusstest","bn":"A1 লেভেল টেস্ট"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe ___ Mutter in der Küche.","options":["meine","meiner","meinen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"helfen + Dativ; die Mutter → meiner","id":"a1-exam-q1"},{"type":"order","prompt":"ট্রেন সাড়ে সাতটায় ছাড়ে।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Der","Zug","fährt","um","halb","acht","ab"],"accept":["Um halb acht fährt der Zug ab"],"extra":["Die","fährst"],"id":"a1-exam-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich hole meine Freundin vom Bahnhof ___. (abholen)","answers":["ab"],"options":["ab","an","aus"],"promptBn":"trennbares Verb: উপসর্গটি বাক্যের শেষে যায়","explanation":"abholen → ich hole … ab","id":"a1-exam-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir fahren ___ Bus zur Arbeit.","options":["mit dem","mit den","mit der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"mit + Dativ; der Bus → dem Bus","id":"a1-exam-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Morgen ___ ich nicht kommen, ich bin krank.","options":["kann","kannst","können"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ich → kann","id":"a1-exam-q5"},{"type":"order","prompt":"সপ্তাহান্তে আমি দাদিকে দেখতে যাই।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Am","Wochenende","besuche","ich","meine","Oma"],"accept":["Ich besuche am Wochenende meine Oma"],"extra":["du","mein"],"id":"a1-exam-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich habe ___ Zeit. Ich muss arbeiten.","answers":["keine"],"options":["keine","kein","keinen"],"promptBn":"Zeit স্ত্রীলিঙ্গ","explanation":"die Zeit → keine Zeit","id":"a1-exam-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Kennst du den Mann? – Ja, ich kenne ___.","options":["er","ihn","ihm"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ: er → ihn","id":"a1-exam-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ bitte das Fenster, es ist kalt! (du)","options":["Mach … zu","Machst … zu","Machen … zu"],"answer":0,"explanation":"du-Imperativ: Mach das Fenster zu!","id":"a1-exam-q9"},{"type":"order","prompt":"আমি কোথায় টিকিট কিনতে পারি?","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Wo","kann","ich","eine","Fahrkarte","kaufen"],"accept":[],"extra":["kannst","du"],"id":"a1-exam-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er ___ jeden Morgen um sechs Uhr auf. (aufstehen)","answers":["steht"],"options":["steht","stehe","stehst"],"promptBn":"er-এর রূপ বেছে নিন","explanation":"aufstehen → er steht … auf","id":"a1-exam-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Kinder ___ im Park.","options":["spielt","spielen","spielst"],"answer":1,"explanation":"die Kinder (sie, Plural) → spielen","id":"a1-exam-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wie heißt der Plural von „das Buch“?","options":["die Buchs","die Bücher","die Buche"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-exam-q13"},{"type":"order","prompt":"দুঃখিত, আজ আমার সময় নেই।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Leider","habe","ich","heute","keine","Zeit"],"accept":["Ich habe heute leider keine Zeit","Heute habe ich leider keine Zeit"],"extra":["hast","du"],"id":"a1-exam-q14"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Termin ist am Montag ___ zehn Uhr.","answers":["um"],"options":["um","auf","nach"],"promptBn":"ঘড়ির সময়ের আগে কোন প্রিপজিশন?","explanation":"Uhrzeit → um zehn Uhr","id":"a1-exam-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„umsteigen“ মানে …","options":["গাড়ি বদল করা","গাড়ি থেকে নামা","গাড়িতে উঠা"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-exam-q16"},{"type":"order","prompt":"আমি আসছি না, কারণ আমি অসুস্থ।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Ich","komme","nicht,","denn","ich","bin","krank"],"accept":[],"extra":["Du","bist"],"id":"a1-exam-q17"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Liebe Maria, vielen Dank für ___ Brief! (dein)","answers":["deinen"],"options":["deinen","deine","deinem"],"promptBn":"der Brief, Akkusativ","explanation":"für + Akkusativ: deinen Brief","id":"a1-exam-q18"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Entschuldigung, wie komme ich ___ Bahnhof?","options":["zum","zur","nach"],"answer":0,"explanation":"zu + dem → zum (der Bahnhof)","id":"a1-exam-q19"},{"type":"order","prompt":"তুমি কি আমাকে একটু সাহায্য করতে পারবে?","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Kannst","du","mir","bitte","helfen"],"accept":[],"extra":["Kann","ich"],"id":"a1-exam-q20"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a1-exam","level":"A1","test":[]}